								"{\"text\":\"modpack. At the time of writing this book it is November 17, 2022. I truly hope someone completes this and sees this book. There is nothing after this, no quests, no nothing, everything has been completed. Thank you for playing this small modpack of mine. Truly means a lot.\"}"
