							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Hello, Random Stranger on the Internet who has decided to play my modpack. I am Kade, the sole creator of this pack and I would like to congratulate you on reaching Day 500. Truly a good moment in time. \\n\\nI Hope you had fun playing my modpack \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"even though there had been some ups and downs but I think it turned out well. \\n\\nTheres nothing special about reaching this day really just something I thought of one day...\\n\\nAnyways whether or not you read this book I have no idea.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Anyways this book is used for the end of the modpack and will be needed to complete the quest. \\n\\nAfter you turn in the book to the quest you'll be rewarded with yet another book that I hope you'll read.\\n\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"         Anyways\\nI hope you enjoyed this modpack that I started as a passion project. I hope you have a great rest of your day.\\n\\nFarewell, Stranger on the Internet.\"}"
